 all our FAQ&#x27;s<!-- --> <a class="text-charcoal underline" href="/support/faqs">here</a>, or reach out to us any time using<!-- --> <a class="text-charcoal underline" href="tel:8882626498">phone</a> <!-- -->or<!-- --> <a class="text-charcoal underline" href="mailto:support@uneekor.com">email</a>.</p></div></div><div class="max-w-360 mx-auto pt-12.5 pb-12.5 lg:pb-25 w-full relative overflow-hidden px-[32px] lg:px-[100px]"><div class="w-full flex flex-col gap-md "><div class="w-full border border-x-0 border-t-0 px-md py-xl"><div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5 text-black"><h4 class=" text-left">What’s included with the EYE MINI?</h4><button type="button" class="hover:cursor-pointer min-w-10 min-h-10 flex items-center justify-center bg-sand rounded-md hover:opacity-75"><div class=" transition-all duration-300"><div class="rotate-90 absolute w-[13px] h-0.5 rounded-full bg-black"></div><div class=" transition-all duration-300 w-[13px] h-0.5 rounded-full bg-black"></div></div></button></div><div style="height:0px" class="transition-[height, opacity] duration-300 opacity-0 pointer-events-none"><div class="body-large text-charcoal"><p class="font-bold">Hardware</p><p>EYE MINI Launch Monitor</p><br/><p class="font-bold">Software</p><p><a class="text-blue hover:underline" href="/golf-simulator-software/launcher">Uneekor Launcher</a></p><p><a class="text-blue hover:underline" href="#software-packages">Player Package Included</a></p><p><a class="text-blue hover:underline" href="#software-packages">3-month Ultimate Package Trial Included</a></p><p><a class="text-blue hover:underline" href="/golf-simulator-software/view">VIEW AIR for Ipad</a></p><br/><p class="font-bold">Parts</p><p>EYE MINI Carrying Case with Carrying Strap - (1) count</p><p>11ft Power Cable and Adapter - 11ft</p><p>CAT6 Ethernet Cable - (1) count</p><p>EYE MINI Club Stickers - (1,280) count / 20 sheets</p><p>Alignment Rod - (1) count</p><p>Tweezers - (1) count</p></div></div></div><div class="w-full border border-x-0 border-t-0 px-md py-xl"><div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5 text-black"><h4 class=" text-left">Do I need a subscription to use EYE MINI?</h4><button type="button" class="hover:cursor-pointer min-w-10 min-h-10 flex items-center justify-center bg-sand rounded-md hover:opacity-75"><div class=" transition-all duration-300"><div class="rotate-90 absolute w-[13px] h-0.5 rounded-full bg-black"></div><div class=" transition-all duration-300 w-[13px] h-0.5 rounded-full bg-black"></div></div></button></div><div style="height:0px" class="transition-[height, opacity] duration-300 opacity-0 pointer-events-none"><div class="body-large text-charcoal">Yes, a software package is required to use the EYE MINI. Every Uneekor launch monitor includes the Player Package, which gives you all the essential tools to start your golf simulation journey. To unlock additional features such as REFINE, AI Trainer, and GameDay, a subscription upgrade is required</div></div></div><div class="w-full border border-x-0 border-t-0 px-md py-xl"><div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5 text-black"><h4 class=" text-left">Does EYE MINI work with AI Trainer?</h4><button type="button" class="hover:cursor-pointer min-w-10 min-h-10 flex items-center justify-center bg-sand rounded-md hover:opacity-75"><div class=" transition-all duration-300"><div class="rotate-90 absolute w-[13px] h-0.5 rounded-full bg-black"></div><div class=" transition-all duration-300 w-[13px] h-0.5 rounded-full bg-black"></div></div></button></div><div style="height:0px" class="transition-[height, opacity] duration-300 opacity-0 pointer-events-none"><div class="body-large text-charcoal">Yes, the EYE MINI is fully compatible with AI Trainer. To use AI Trainer, VIEW software requires Swing Optix® cameras, which enable the system to deliver real-time, personalized swing analysis. Swing Optix® cameras can be purchased as add-on</div></div></div></div></div><div class=" h-[32px] w-full bg-yellow"></div><div><div class="px-5 md:px-12.5 lg:px-25"><div class=" w-full text-center p-[32px] px-5 md:p-[50px] lg:p-[100px] lg:pb-[50px]"><div class="mx-auto flex flex-col gap-md"><h1 class="text-black max-w-[600px]`">Still can&#x27;t decide?</h1><p class="body-large max-w-[700px] mx-auto">Take a look at our full range and work out which suits you best.</p></div></div><div class="flex justify-center"><div class="flex gap-md md:gap-xl min-w-68.75 lg:min-w-125 overflow-x-scroll x-scrollbox scrollbar-hide"><div class="min-w-68.75 max-w-125 flex flex-col gap-sm items-start w-full h-fit rounded-md border-[0.5px] border-lightGray p-xl"><div class="w-full relative"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="318" height="216" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-md w-full object-cover aspect-square" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0388/4423/5907/files/hf_20260629_185543_f221f428-619f-40fb-b319-00671910a168.png?v=1783547373"/><div class="absolute bottom-0 h-full left-0 flex flex-col justify-end gap-sm z-10"><div class="mt-auto flex flex-col gap-sm"></div></div></div><div class="text-left"><i class=" fa-kit fa-eye-mini fa-md"></i><p class="line-clamp-4! body-small">Professional performance in a portable design. The EYE MINI&#x27;s high-speed camera technology and unmatched accuracy ensure that every swing is tracked with precision. Discover the ultimate practice partner and elevate your game without compromising on space.</p><button type="button" class="hover:cursor-pointer float-left text-blue body-small" data-testid="full-desc">Show more</button></div><div><p class="text-[10px] text-charcoal font-light">starting at</p><div class="flex gap-1"><span>$4,500</span></div></div><div class="space-y-md w-full"><button type="button" disabled="" class="relative flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-center font-medium focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 !rounded-sm !px-lg !py-[12px] !font-bold group ring-0! outline-none! h-